{"id":"SEC-001","category":"security","criterion":"authorization","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4,"file":"head/evals/harness/pipeline-run.sh","line":258,"code_snippet":"if [[ \"$EVAL_ONLY\" == true && \"${LOA_ABLATION_BATCH_CONTEXT:-}\" != 1 ]]; then","reasoning_trace":"Dissent DISS-C-001 (companion claude-headless) flagged; verified: refusal reads .eval_only only (:258-262); overlay opens on toggles.oracle_open (:336-338); the oracle_open=>eval_only invariant is enforced only in validate-suite.sh (:176-177), which pipeline-run.sh never runs; marker is a plain env var (:146-147 documents setting it). Mitigation: rows carry oracle_open evidence and the report keeps them reported-never-excluded (:1136-1142).","finding":"Refusal keys on the declarative eval_only flag, not on the toggle that opens the oracle; invariant one process away","critique":"A hand-edited or unvalidated suite with oracle_open:true and no eval_only runs the open mount outside a batch and is never refused.","remediation":"Refuse on toggles.oracle_open==true without the marker as well; exit 2 when oracle_open:true appears without eval_only:true.","confidence":"medium","references":["CWE-693","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/693.html"]}
