{"id":"ARCH-004","category":"architecture","criterion":"resilience","severity":"LOW","score":4,"file":"head/evals/harness/pipeline-run.sh","line":258,"code_snippet":"if [[ \"$EVAL_ONLY\" == true && \"${LOA_ABLATION_BATCH_CONTEXT:-}\" != 1 ]]; then","reasoning_trace":"The eval_only refusal precedes the applicability REFUSAL report (:326) and applies to --dry-run; no caller in the diff dry-runs every arm through pipeline-run.sh (grep: run-ablation.sh --dry-run never calls it).","finding":"Refusal ordering: eval_only reason masks the task-type reason; a future every-arm dry run exits 2","critique":"Design note, speculative; no current caller affected.","remediation":"Let --dry-run through unconditionally and refuse only a real run.","confidence":"low","references":["CWE-696","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/696.html"]}
